    "identifier": "blunt-force-connection",
    "description": "<p>You take a stance that allows you to place all of your weight behind your attack. Make a melee taijutsu attack against a target creature. On a hit, you deal your weapons damage + 4d8 and the target must make a Strength saving throw, falling Prone on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: A 15-foot cube originating from you becomes difficult terrain.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: A creature that fails their saving throw, becomes Bruised.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and damage by 1d8.</p>",
